WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.200
The number outside a bracket multiplies every term inside.

2
00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:09.625
Two lots of x plus three is two rows: two x, and six ones.

3
00:00:10.554 --> 00:00:15.329
Three rows: three x plus nine. The three multiplies both terms.

4
00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:22.960
Three lots of x minus one: each row takes one away. Three x minus three.
